{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSPredicate","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"filter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property in the style JSON.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the “","type":"text"},{"text":"Predicates and Expressions","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":3,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute is 5"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or 10 and whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ele"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCompoundPredicate"},{"type":"text","text":" along these lines:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["